# Build-time artifacts, never committed - same rule as the native cores and the
# Vazirmatn font binaries.
#
#   tor/geoip, tor/geoip6  <- fetched by scripts/build-overlay-cores.sh
#   psiphon.config         <- network-issued client identity, supplied through
#                             PSIPHON_CONFIG_B64 / PSIPHON_CONFIG_FILE at build
#                             time, or pasted by the user in Settings > Chain.
#
# This file starts with a dot, so AGP's default asset-ignore pattern keeps it
# out of the APK; it exists so the assets/ directory itself is present in a
# fresh checkout and resource merging never sees a missing source dir.
/tor/
/psiphon.config
